WEBVTT

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:31.684
Too many disciplines are necessary
to master for one venture to go alone.

00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:34.268
It is about cooperation,

00:02:34.292 --> 00:02:36.000
not competition.

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:41.601
Deep tech is ultimately
transforming discovery

00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:45.393
into a design and engineering exercise.

00:02:45.417 --> 00:02:47.059
So ...

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.833
why does it matter?

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:53.518
It matters because it is happening now,

00:02:53.542 --> 00:02:54.976
all around us,

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.250
ongoing.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.226
This approach is changing
what was once considered impossible